  "@type": "sc:Dataset",
  "name": "FusionRS",
  "description": "A rights-redacted index of 600,000 remote-sensing source identifiers, fixed groups and splits, locally reconstructable infrared-style views, and text-supervision availability metadata. No upstream image bytes, translated image bytes, source-caption strings, or uncleared derived-caption strings are distributed.",
