  "usageInfo": "Index-only research release. Users must obtain upstream data through official routes and comply with source-specific terms. Translated infrared-style views are not physical thermal measurements. Individual identification, persistent tracking, operational targeting, autonomous surveillance, weapon-related decisions, and safety-critical uses are outside the intended scope.",
